# SPA fallback — every unmatched path goes to the SSR function. The
# netlify.toml already declares this redirect, but having a public/_redirects
# file is a belt-and-braces measure that keeps the rewrite working even if
# the netlify.toml redirect ever gets removed from the build.
#
# Nitro 3's Netlify preset writes the SSR handler to
# `.netlify/functions-internal/server` (Functions v2). Plain `/.netlify/functions/...`
# paths go to the Functions v1 router which no longer applies.
/*    /.netlify/functions-internal/server   200
